=== PARITY (vs web AutomationActivityFeed.tsx) ===
  Data sources -> bound via the shared state-holder seam (AutomationFeedSource ->
    AutomationFeedModel): the web leaf's only hook is useTranslation; it receives history /
    historyStats / isLoading / liveEvents / connectionState as props from its parent
    (the automations history query + the useAutomationEvents SSE stream). The native source
    carries that prop snapshot; the view performs NO HTTP.
  Projection -> 1:1 ports verified by EXECUTED XCTest: statusConfig[status] ?? running (8
    statuses), typeMap[type] ?? triggered (5 kinds), formatDurationMs (nil->'—', <1000->'{ms}ms',
    else '{(ms/1000).toFixed(1)}s'), fmtPercent(rate, 0), name ?? '#{automation_id}',
    liveEvents.slice(0,5), the historyStats && total_executions>0 stats gate, and empty-string
    error/reason folding to nil.
  Composition -> FadeIn(delay 0.1) + GlassPanel; header = Activity glyph + "Recent Activity" +
    connection chip, with the gated stats summary ({total} total · {rate} success · {avg} avg)
    trailing; up to five live SSE rows (pulsing kind icon · name · error/reason · neutral kind
    badge); then the history list (status icon · name · error · time-ago · duration · actions).
  Shared components -> Color.TS / Font.TS / TSSpacing / TSRadius / TSGlassPanel / TSFadeIn /
    TSSkeleton, compiled against the real iOS-18 + macOS-15 SDKs in the typechecks below.
    Recharts -> none / Leaflet -> none (no chart/map on this surface).
  States (all render) -> loading (5 skeleton rows) · empty ("No execution history yet") ·
    error (QueryError-equivalent retry — native chrome, since the web leaf's parent owns the
    query) · stale (chip + cached banner + one guarded auto-refresh) · offline (cached rows +
    chip + banner) · data. The live rows + stats + connection chip render independently of the
    history phase (the web renders them outside the isLoading branch).
  i18n -> all 7 source strings + the routed statusConfig/typeMap labels resolve through the
    P1/S10 facade (table "AutomationActivityFeed") with the web English fallback. No English
    literal in native code (verbatim Text only wraps facade output / runtime data).

=== ACCESSIBILITY ===
  Connection chip + stats + each live/history row + the banner are single combined
  accessibility elements; the title carries .isHeader; decorative icons are
  .accessibilityHidden. Each row's spoken value is the VoiceOver summary from
  AutomationFeedAccessibility (name · status/kind · time · duration · actions · error/reason),
  asserted by the executed a11y tests. Dynamic Type via the Font.TS text styles; Reduce Motion
  honored by the pulse modifier (+ TSFadeIn / TSSkeleton). Minimums: iOS 18 / iPadOS 18 / macOS 15.

